[{"client_msg_id":"1022f2f1-9e17-4044-8a3f-2881d04cc154","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"VMからHDDにクローンしてるけど50GBぐらいなのにまじ2時間ぐらいかかってる","ts":"1618659125.216800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"nbkeh"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0b564d3a-213b-4781-904c-a9f55e31fab9","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"snapshots から Dropbox を全部削除したけど、容量は大して増えなかった。そりゃそうか。逆に言うとちゃんと差分スナップショットになってる","ts":"1618648497.216000","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"goodpoem","count":1,"users":["U013QL1RAPN"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=lsH"}]},{"client_msg_id":"14a41b77-93ad-41b4-8874-adeb72f8964c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"そもそもまず `btrfs filesystem df` の出力の見方がちゃんとわかってない…","ts":"1618648454.215200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"2x8"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e05fd0d2-7473-4879-8718-01f6cf5f1d7d","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"差分量で発生してた増量が減った?","ts":"1618648005.214700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UTmP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"ed051812-ca1d-42c4-933b-bb2f2d950ae4","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"削除した結果、無事復活した。\nところで total まで減ってるのがよくわかっていない…。\n```❯ sudo btrfs filesystem df .\nData, single: total=214.48GiB, used=103.79GiB\nSystem, single: total=4.00MiB, used=64.00KiB\nMetadata, single: total=19.01GiB, used=6.67GiB\nGlobalReserve, single: total=485.27MiB, used=0.00B```","ts":"1618647898.214300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mp1E1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e9708d64-9574-4932-8a5c-c308650b67e0","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"サーバー移行で必要なファイルを見繕いたいけど\n必要なファイル一覧のドキュメントがないと\n打ち明けられた筆者の心境を述べよ(10点)","ts":"1618633926.213700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"QxS"}]},{"client_msg_id":"41754ec0-7b47-4480-8d4e-f118bc8fe68a","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"ブートローダー周りとかfstab辺り以外は物理構成に依存してないので楽","ts":"1618629649.212000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"twCB"}]},{"client_msg_id":"b52bf178-b7ca-4d4e-abfc-7fdf3640674e","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"実は普通に行ける(経験者)","ts":"1618629619.211900","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wxKc5"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7d887a42-b2a4-407b-9e2a-85d76c4bff60","type":"message","user":"U01AQ5BFNLX","text":"ふと、archとかwifiの関係でインストールできないなら、VM作って物理HDDにクローンすれば行けるのではと思い立ったのでやってみよう","ts":"1618629585.211800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lLnp"}]},{"client_msg_id":"41386ffa-bcfb-49e2-b669-e2c11de12233","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"改めて考えると別に snapshot いらんディレクトリ他にもあるので整理している…Dropbox とか…","ts":"1618627792.210600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"=tChE"}]},{"client_msg_id":"809133b8-adf0-4d58-99f0-865009dd1d91","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"まだ削除終わってないけどもりもり削除して息を吹き返している\nさて、slacklog の部分は独立した subvolme に退避しないとだな (全て忘れたので調べ直している)","ts":"1618627002.210000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"MJbF"}]},{"client_msg_id":"aed833ff-73c9-4548-b651-928eb82b85ab","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"スクリプトは諦めて zsh 上で実行している。どうもシェル間でコマンド履歴が共有されないなーなどと思っていたが、これたぶん容量不足で履歴ファイルに書き込めてないですね","ts":"1618626887.209000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"G8qxP"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0d100c16-ec08-43f7-ad9c-e0acf7a41d3c","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"修正のためのスクリプトを書いていたが(一旦全てのスナップショットから該当パスを消す)、スクリプトの保存が容量不足でエラーになるw","ts":"1618626179.207600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"warau","count":3,"users":["U9S4G0LJW","UAZ33BKV2","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Vm0"}]},{"client_msg_id":"e6b2566b-7f54-477a-840f-c5a7ceb2e5cd","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"日々 slacklog を更新し続けるスクリプトと日々 btrfs で daily snapshot を取り続けるスクリプトが悪魔的合体を果たした結果\n\n```❯ sudo btrfs filesystem df .\nData, single: total=400.48GiB, used=400.48GiB\nSystem, single: total=4.00MiB, used=64.00KiB\nMetadata, single: total=19.01GiB, used=16.66GiB\nGlobalReserve, single: total=512.00MiB, used=0.00B```","ts":"1618625177.206200","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"japanese_goblin","count":2,"users":["U03C4RC8X","U01BY3SDBRS"]},{"name":"smiling_imp","count":2,"users":["U03C4RC8X","UAZ33BKV2"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"JNLh"}]}]
